  "lesson": "## Pads as an instrument\n\nSet hot cues 1 to 4 on a kick, clap, hat and a vocal stab. Each bar plays a pad on beats 1, 2, 3, the and-of-3, and 4, rotating which pad owns the bar. The and-of-3 is the hard one: it is an eighth note, and sloppy eighths are what make pad play sound amateur.\n\nTiming target here is under 40 ms. Set the metronome on until it is.\n",
